GazLang - A simple programming language compiler
Usage: gazlang [options] [--] [program arguments...]
Options:
  -h, --help     Show this help message
  -v, --version  Show version information
  -c, --code         Print the compiled bytecode instead of running it (gazlang -c -f x.gaz > x.gzb)
  -t, --tokens   Print the lexer's tokens, one LINE TYPE VALUE per line, instead of interpreting
      --ast      Print the parser's tree instead of running it
  -f, --file     Read input from a file instead of stdin
